@paulirish/trace_engine 0.0.65: the edits DevTools' packaging script
(scripts/trace/prep-trace-engine-package.sh, not published) made to DevTools'
sources at 845cad7f273101ef8ae5a8e741dccd78f6f14724 before compiling them, i.e.
the difference between that commit's files and the package's source maps'
sourcesContent:
- const enums become enums (TraceEvents.ts: MarkerName moves below the Name
  enum it uses, which a non-const enum needs);
- core/common (ParsedURL) isn't packaged: ScriptsHandler.ts gets a completeURL()
  using URL, NetworkDependencyTree.ts a copy of ParsedURL, Trace.ts uses
  URL.parse();
- core/platform/HostRuntime.ts: HOST_RUNTIME's top-level await, which loads
  modules the package doesn't have, becomes a stub;
- CLSCulprits.ts: toSorted() becomes a sorted copy (older Node.js);
- ImageDelivery.ts: two return types are LocalizedString.

